  "description": "YITAMOTOR 46\" Skid Steer Pallet forks Frame. This skid steer pallet forks blade has 4000 lbs Bearing Capacity, Can easily and quickly haul lumber, and firewood, move fence posts, hay bales, etc.\nFitment\nFits JD loaders and tractors only.\nFeatures\nFor John Deere.\nYITAMOTOR pallet fork frame fits JD loaders and tractors only; the Product is in John Deere Green color to ensure a perfect match to your loader.\nQuality Steel & Double Protection.\nThe skid steer pallet fork frame is made from heavy-duty grade 50 steel that can withstand up to 4,000 pounds of pulling force, enabling you to effortlessly carry heavy objects; The joint use of powder coating and painted finish makes us stand out from other single finish applied alternatives; This double application grants a robust & smooth surface that has excellent rust & scratch resistance.\nRemovable Pallet Fork Blades and Spears.\nUnique slotted carriage bar and bale spear sleeve design allow for flexible tractor maneuvers; Combine or separate use of pallet forks and hay spear per your needs; Get the most out of different work situations.\nEasy to Use.\nThe pallet fork frame is a quick-connect skid steer that can be directly installed to the machine for versatile use (can be used with pallet fork); The extended top bracket reduces timber slipping risk during handling.\nSpecifications and Reliable Service.\nThe skid steer pallet fork frame's total weight: 128 lbs, total length: 50 inches, total height: 30 inches (Pallet forks and hay spear not included).",
